								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=1856.msg24533#msg24533">22 (or more) dead at Virginia Tech.</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> April 16, 2007, 11:20:49 am &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
