							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">Interesting thing is that people think America is this gun loving country, but the Swiss own more guns percapita than any other country.&nbsp; The differance between the US and the Swiss has more to do with our differance in education and culture.&nbsp; In Switzerland everybody has to pay their dues in the Army.&nbsp; While you&#039;re in the army you assigned a weapon and you have to basically have your rifel with you at all times.&nbsp; Becasue of this the general respect for weapons is hightened.&nbsp; (and yo!&nbsp; I&#039;m not some NRA wacko and I don&#039;t own a gun.&nbsp; I just think a lack of education and respect for weapons in our culture is a major factor in our country.&nbsp; Also the media doesn&#039;t help.)<br /></div>
						</td>
